# The Canyon Set source pack. It is an input, not a deliverable: the meshes it
# supplies are baked into resources/canyon_props.tres by tools/bake_props.gd,
# nothing loads it at runtime and it is excluded from the export. 47 MB, and
# one of its paths is long enough that Windows refuses to index it.
assets/LoafbrrAssets/

